# co-subscriber, all events
subscribed o/r#12 events=all
polling every 1m (next in 58s); also watched by: w2:p1
updates arrive in this pane; unsub: pr-relay unsub https://github.com/o/r/pull/12
# no co-subscribers, ci mask
subscribed o/r#12 events=ci.failed,ci.settled (closed always included)
polling every 1m (next in 58s)
updates arrive in this pane; unsub: pr-relay unsub https://github.com/o/r/pull/12
# updated, two co-subscribers
updated o/r#12 events=all
polling every 1m (next in 58s); also watched by: w2:p1, /tmp/other.sock:w1:p3
updates arrive in this pane; unsub: pr-relay unsub https://github.com/o/r/pull/12
